<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar says buys 30,000T sugar supply.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar says buys 30,000T sugar supply.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp said on Thursday it has completed a contract to buy 30,000 tonnes of sugar from Czarnikow at a private tender in New York.</p>
</text>
